@startuml
title Customer CERSAI Consent API - Business Process

actor Customer
participant CRM
participant "EIS (DMZ)" as EIS
participant "CERSAI Consent API" as API

Customer -> CRM: Provide consent

CRM -> EIS: Submit customer consent

EIS -> API: Forward request

API -> API: Identify customer\nand verify details

alt Customer not valid
    API --> EIS: Customer validation failure
else Customer valid
    API -> API: Validate consent TAT

    alt TAT expired
        API --> EIS: Consent not considered\nCustomer eligible for CERSAI download
    else TAT valid
        API -> API: Process consent

        API --> EIS: Consent processed
    end
end

EIS --> CRM: Standard response

@enduml